BUGS-NEWS
=========

Current status for localed 0.2.0 (unreleased).

Known limitations
-----------------

* The built-in console-keymap ↔ X11 layout conversion table covers common
  mappings only. When no mapping exists, localed leaves the other keyboard
  setting unchanged rather than guessing.

* The X11 reader supports the conventional one-option-per-line form
  `Option "Name" "value"`. Unusual syntax, multiple options on one line, or
  non-standard quoting may not be interpreted. Use localectl or the D-Bus
  interface to write the managed keyboard configuration.

* Locale and keyboard identifiers are deliberately restricted to conservative
  character allowlists and a maximum length of 256 bytes. Values outside
  those limits are rejected or ignored.

The former 0.1.x issue list included bugs that have since been fixed and is
not repeated here. The commit history retains those details.

